spec: S04-02, S04-03, S04-07, S04-08

Seeds the Threads the read-only `50-threads` cases look at, on `th-plan` (the sidecar
prototype's v1 text): t1 document-level, resolved via `reply --resolve` (mentions @scribe);
t2 anchored span with mentions both ways; t3 span, root edited (two mentions), resolved by
@rowan; t4 span with a tombstoned reply; t5 span with a tombstoned root and a live reply; t6
document-level, fully tombstoned (hidden from lists). Merged stdout+stderr; ids are random.
(The text references three files that are not in the sandbox — ticket 03's push warns and records
them as missing Assets; the Sidecar golden in `50-threads/pull-threads.out/` shows them.)

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push th-plan.md -m "first draft"
warning: missing asset img/architecture.png (not found) — pushed with missing:true
warning: missing asset img/cli-screenshot.png (not found) — pushed with missing:true
warning: missing asset api-notes.md (not found) — pushed with missing:true
assets: 3 referenced, 0 new, 3 missing (img/architecture.png, img/cli-screenshot.png, api-notes.md)
th-plan	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan thread new th-plan --document -m "Needs a **Risks** section before I can approve. @scribe can you add one?"
t1	document

$ annotary -p agent thread reply th-plan t1 --resolve -m "Added §Risks in v2."
t1.1	resolved

$ annotary -p rowan thread new th-plan "16:0-16:33" -m "Agreed — but the skill file must land *with* the CLI, not after. @scribe make sure the order list says so."
t2	v1:16:0-16:33 "We ship the CLI before the web UI"

$ annotary -p agent thread reply th-plan t2 -m "Item 3 already lists the skill file with the CLI. @rowan do you want it as its own item?"
t2.1

$ annotary -p agent thread new th-plan "11:48-11:69" -m "Should the anchor engine be its own package? @rowan @linter"
t3	v1:11:48-11:69 "testable in isolation"

$ annotary -p agent thread edit th-plan t3 -m "Should the anchor engine be its own package so the CLI and server share one implementation? @rowan @linter"
t3	edited

$ annotary -p rowan thread resolve th-plan t3
t3	resolved

$ annotary -p rowan thread new th-plan "20:41-20:73" --version 1 -m "Three feels low for useful signal. Five?"
t4	v1:20:41-20:73 "invite three external developers"

$ annotary -p agent thread reply th-plan t4 -m "oops, wrong thread"
t4.1

$ annotary -p agent thread delete th-plan t4.1
t4.1	deleted

$ annotary -p agent thread new th-plan "3:0-3:14" -m "Diagram is out of date — the daemon box is missing."
t5	v1:3:0-3:14 "![architecture"

$ annotary -p rowan thread reply th-plan t5 -m "(Replying to the deleted question: yes — the fixture table is also the seed of the test suite.)"
t5.1

$ annotary -p agent thread delete th-plan t5
t5	deleted

$ annotary -p agent thread new th-plan --document -m "scratch that"
t6	document

$ annotary -p agent thread delete th-plan t6
t6	deleted

```
